<section class="zynggi-policy-section">
  <div class="zynggi-policy-container">

    <h1>Return &amp; Replacement Policy</h1>

    <div class="zynggi-policy-content">

      <h3>1. Product Quality Check</h3>

      <p>
        Delivery ke time product ko check kar lein. Agar product ki quality se
        aap satisfied nahi hain, to delivery ke time hi return ya replacement
        request kar sakte hain.
      </p>

      <p>
        Agar delivery ke time product check nahi kar paaye, to
        <strong>delivery ke 24–48 hours ke andar</strong> hume complaint karein.
      </p>


      <h3>2. Damaged / Defective Product</h3>

      <p>
        Agar product damaged hai ya manufacturing defect hai, to
        <strong>product ki clear photos ke saath</strong> complaint bhejein.
      </p>

      <p>
        Verification ke baad Zynggi product ko
        <strong>replace</strong> kiya ja sakta hai.
      </p>


      <h3>3. Wrong Product Received</h3>

      <p>
        Agar aapko order kiye gaye product ke badle koi
        <strong>different product</strong> milta hai, to hum usse correct
        product ke saath replace karenge.
      </p>


      <h3>4. Refund Policy</h3>

      <p>
        Zynggi par generally <strong>cash refund available nahi hai</strong>.
        Eligible cases me refund ke badle
        <strong>product replacement</strong> provide kiya jayega.
      </p>


      <h3>5. Delivery Attempt &amp; Re-shipping</h3>

      <p>
        Agar delivery first attempt par nahi ho pati because:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Address incorrect ya incomplete hai</li>
        <li>Customer available nahi hai</li>
        <li>Address locked hai</li>
        <li>Customer order receive karne se mana karta hai</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Aise cases me order ke liye refund nahi diya jayega.
        Dobara delivery ke liye
        <strong>₹30 additional re-shipping charge</strong> applicable hoga.
      </p>


      <h3>6. Order Cancellation</h3>

      <p>
        Order confirm hone ke baad
        <strong>customer-side cancellation generally accepted nahi hai.</strong>
      </p>


      <h3>7. Replacement Request</h3>

      <p>
        Replacement ke liye hume contact karein:
      </p>

      <div class="zynggi-contact-box">

        <a href="tel:+919728326350">
          📞 +91 9728326350
        </a>

        <a href="mailto:Contact.zynggi@gmail.com">
          📧 Contact.zynggi@gmail.com
        </a>

      </div>

      <p>
        Complaint ke saath
        <strong>order details aur product ki clear photos</strong>
        share karein.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .zynggi-policy-section {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .zynggi-policy-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .zynggi-policy-container h2 {
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #222222;
  }

  .zynggi-policy-content h3 {
    margin: 30px 0 10px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #222222;
  }

  .zynggi-policy-content p,
  .zynggi-policy-content li {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #555555;
  }

  .zynggi-policy-content ul {
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .zynggi-contact-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: #f7f7f7;
    border-left: 4px solid #9f2608;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .zynggi-contact-box a {
    color: #222222;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .zynggi-contact-box a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .zynggi-policy-section {
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .zynggi-policy-container h2 {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .zynggi-policy-content h3 {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .zynggi-policy-content p,
    .zynggi-policy-content li,
    .zynggi-contact-box a {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
  }
</style>


{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Return & Replacement",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Return & Replacement"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}